      "richText": "<article class=\"markdown-body entry-content container-lg\" itemprop=\"text\"><p align=\"center\" dir=\"auto\">\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"/wonseokjung/connect-ai/blob/main/assets/icon.png\"><img src=\"/wonseokjung/connect-ai/raw/main/assets/icon.png\" width=\"120\" alt=\"Connect AI Logo\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h1 align=\"center\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Connect AI v2 (P-Reinforce)</h1><a id=\"user-content-connect-ai-v2-p-reinforce\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Connect AI v2 (P-Reinforce)\" href=\"#connect-ai-v2-p-reinforce\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p align=\"center\" dir=\"auto\">\n  <strong>100% Local · 100% Offline · Autonomous Knowledge Engine</strong><br>\n  VS Code / Cursor 확장 프로그램으로, 당신의 낡은 IDE를 최상위 에이전트 대학(A.U)의 심장으로 진화시킵니다.\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\" dir=\"auto\">\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/9b30d4aba56a44cf14512fbdb84b135d1184279670a21d35841c7399343acecc/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f76657273696f6e2d322e312e33302d626c7565\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/9b30d4aba56a44cf14512fbdb84b135d1184279670a21d35841c7399343acecc/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f76657273696f6e2d322e312e33302d626c7565\" alt=\"version\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/version-2.1.30-blue\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/f8df3091bbe1149f398a5369b2c39e896766f9f6efba3477c63e9b4aa940ef14/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f6c6963656e73652d4d49542d677265656e\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/f8df3091bbe1149f398a5369b2c39e896766f9f6efba3477c63e9b4aa940ef14/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f6c6963656e73652d4d49542d677265656e\" alt=\"license\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-green\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/c9f409211413fc295c88f7ea705f30e717d43da26d47d9450385ff0555fcfb98/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f696e746567726174696f6e2d4167656e745f556e69766572736974792d707572706c65\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/c9f409211413fc295c88f7ea705f30e717d43da26d47d9450385ff0555fcfb98/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f696e746567726174696f6e2d4167656e745f556e69766572736974792d707572706c65\" alt=\"integration\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/integration-Agent_University-purple\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>\n  <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/393b353dff3a57a9cfdfa3f0cfe45dd892329eb0610fe2be88fe9024212a169c/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f656e67696e652d4f6c6c616d612532302537432532304c4d25323053747564696f2d6f72616e6765\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/393b353dff3a57a9cfdfa3f0cfe45dd892329eb0610fe2be88fe9024212a169c/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f656e67696e652d4f6c6c616d612532302537432532304c4d25323053747564696f2d6f72616e6765\" alt=\"engine\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/engine-Ollama%20%7C%20LM%20Studio-orange\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">🌟 Overview: The P-Reinforce Architecture</h2><a id=\"user-content--overview-the-p-reinforce-architecture\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 🌟 Overview: The P-Reinforce Architecture\" href=\"#-overview-the-p-reinforce-architecture\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Connect AI v2.1.30은 단순한 코딩 에이전트를 넘어섭니다. <strong>P-Reinforce 아키텍처</strong>를 기반으로 설계된 이 에이전트는 사용자의 모든 정보와 지시를 받아들여 <strong>스스로 의미를 분석하고, 폴더를 생성하고, 마크다운 위키 파일로 정리하여 클라우드에 자동 백업</strong>하는 자율 지식 정원사(Autonomous Gardener)입니다.</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">⚡ Core Features</h2><a id=\"user-content--core-features\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: ⚡ Core Features\" href=\"#-core-features\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">1. 🧠 Agent University (A.U) 완벽 연동</h3><a id=\"user-content-1--agent-university-au-완벽-연동\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 1. 🧠 Agent University (A.U) 완벽 연동\" href=\"#1--agent-university-au-완벽-연동\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent University 웹 플랫폼과 실시간으로 통신합니다.\n웹에서 버튼 한 번 누르는 즉시, 로컬 VS Code의 <code>4825</code> 포트를 통해 프리미엄 브레인 팩(Premium Brain Pack) 지식이 로컬 인공지능 뇌(<code>~/.connect-ai-brain</code>)에 자동 주입되어 신경망을 확장합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">2. 📂 자율 지식 구조화 (Zero-Interaction Styling)</h3><a id=\"user-content-2--자율-지식-구조화-zero-interaction-styling\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 2. 📂 자율 지식 구조화 (Zero-Interaction Styling)\" href=\"#2--자율-지식-구조화-zero-interaction-styling\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">유저가 던져주는 원시 데이터(Raw Data)를 에이전트가 스스로 판단해 <code>10_Wiki</code>, <code>00_Raw</code>, <code>🚀 Skills</code> 와 같은 완벽한 P-Reinforce 템플릿 규격의 Markdown 파일로 분할-조립하여 저장합니다.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">3. ☁️ 클라우드 동기화 (Auto-Git Sync 100%)</h3><a id=\"user-content-3-️-클라우드-동기화-auto-git-sync-100\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 3. ☁️ 클라우드 동기화 (Auto-Git Sync 100%)\" href=\"#3-️-클라우드-동기화-auto-git-sync-100\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">로컬 PC에서 파일 생성이 일어나는 순간, 에이전트가 스스로 GitHub 저장소에 <code>git add</code>, <code>commit</code>, <code>push</code>를 수행합니다.\n마스터는 이제 지루한 푸시 커맨드를 입력할 필요가 없습니다.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">4. 🔗 설치형 모델 자동 감지 (Dynamic Model Detection)</h3><a id=\"user-content-4--설치형-모델-자동-감지-dynamic-model-detection\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 4. 🔗 설치형 모델 자동 감지 (Dynamic Model Detection)\" href=\"#4--설치형-모델-자동-감지-dynamic-model-detection\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Ollama 또는 LM Studio에 설치된 모델을 내부 API(<code>v1/models</code>)를 호출하여 자동 감지하고, UI의 스위치 보드(드롭다운)에 연결합니다. 어떤 모델을 쓸지 번거롭게 입력하지 마십시오.</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">⚒️ Agent Capabilities (에이전트 권한)</h2><a id=\"user-content-️-agent-capabilities-에이전트-권한\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: ⚒️ Agent Capabilities (에이전트 권한)\" href=\"#️-agent-capabilities-에이전트-권한\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">로컬 머신의 파일 시스템과 터미널에 대한 통제권을 인공지능에게 부여합니다. (100% 안전한 권한 승인 기반)</p>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">Action</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Description</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>📄 Create Files</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">새로운 파일과 폴더를 생성합니다</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>✏️ Edit Files</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">기존 파일 내의 코드를 수정합니다</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>🗑️ Delete Files</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">불필요한 파일을 즉각 파쇄합니다</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>📖 Read Files</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">마스터의 프로젝트 파일을 읽어 맥락을 파악합니다</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>📂 Browse Directories</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">디렉토리 구조를 분석합니다</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>🖥️ Run Commands</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>npm run build</code>, <code>git push</code> 등 터미널 명령을 수행합니다</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">📥 Installation (설치 방법)</h2><a id=\"user-content--installation-설치-방법\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 📥 Installation (설치 방법)\" href=\"#-installation-설치-방법\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">A.U 멤버십 유저 (Recommended)</h3><a id=\"user-content-au-멤버십-유저-recommended\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: A.U 멤버십 유저 (Recommended)\" href=\"#au-멤버십-유저-recommended\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>상단 탭의 <a href=\"https://github.com/wonseokjung/connect-ai/releases\">Releases</a> 메뉴로 진입.</li>\n<li>최신 <code>v2.1.30.vsix</code> 파일을 다운로드.</li>\n<li>VS Code 에서 <code>Cmd+Shift+P</code> → <strong>Extensions: Install from VSIX</strong> → 다운받은 파일 선택</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">개발자 빌드 (Build from Source)</h3><a id=\"user-content-개발자-빌드-build-from-source\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 개발자 빌드 (Build from Source)\" href=\"#개발자-빌드-build-from-source\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"git clone https://github.com/wonseokjung/connect-ai.git\ncd connect-ai\nnpm install\nnpm run compile\nnpx vsce package\"><pre>git clone https://github.com/wonseokjung/connect-ai.git\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">cd</span> connect-ai\nnpm install\nnpm run compile\nnpx vsce package</pre></div>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">⚙️ Engine Setup (엔진 설정 방법)</h2><a id=\"user-content-️-engine-setup-엔진-설정-방법\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: ⚙️ Engine Setup (엔진 설정 방법)\" href=\"#️-engine-setup-엔진-설정-방법\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">✅ LM Studio (Apple Silicon, Windows) - 권장</h3><a id=\"user-content--lm-studio-apple-silicon-windows---권장\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: ✅ LM Studio (Apple Silicon, Windows) - 권장\" href=\"#-lm-studio-apple-silicon-windows---권장\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://lmstudio.ai/\" rel=\"nofollow\">lmstudio.ai</a> 에서 설치</li>\n<li>Gemma 3, Llama 3 또는 Qwen Coder 등 원하는 모델 로드</li>\n<li><strong>Developer 탭(좌측 <code>&lt;&gt;</code> 메뉴)</strong> 진입 후 <strong>Start Server</strong> 클릭</li>\n<li>Connect AI의 ⚙️ 채팅방 설정에서 엔진을 \"LM Studio\"로 선택 (자동 모델 인덱싱 완료)</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">✅ Ollama (Mac, Linux)</h3><a id=\"user-content--ollama-mac-linux\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: ✅ Ollama (Mac, Linux)\" href=\"#-ollama-mac-linux\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"brew install ollama\nollama pull gemma3   # 원하는 모델 풀링\"><pre>brew install ollama\nollama pull gemma3   <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> 원하는 모델 풀링</span></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Connect AI에서 설정만 \"Ollama\"로 바꿔주시면 끝납니다.</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">🔒 Privacy (완벽한 보안)</h2><a id=\"user-content--privacy-완벽한-보안\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 🔒 Privacy (완벽한 보안)\" href=\"#-privacy-완벽한-보안\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Zero Cloud API:</strong> 당신의 코드는 외부 클라우드 통신망을 타지 않습니다.</li>\n<li><strong>Zero Telemetry:</strong> 모든 연산력은 100% Local Inference 환경에서 이루어집니다.</li>\n<li>기업 보안 등급에 준하는 극강의 밀폐형 로컬 지식망 생성을 보장합니다.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p align=\"center\" dir=\"auto\">\n  <strong>Built for Antigravity &amp; Agent University</strong><br>\n  Designed by <a href=\"https://github.com/wonseokjung\">Jay</a> × Connect AI Architect\n</p>\n</article>",
